 to the Paint Roller correctly. Improvements - NPCs will now be much less likely to generate trash in cleaner rooms. - Added a notification whenever documents are sent to the Found Papers tray. - Improve readability of furnitur","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:38:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696395","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:00:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1846651706686881","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Hotfix - v0.0.9","summary":"The demo has been updated - thank you for the feedback!Patch notes, hotfix v0.0.9- Enable the player to progress the quest line if the delivery truck is sent away first.- Putting the 4 delivery boxes on the shelf will now correctly always progress the questline.- Greatly reduce the physics impact on delivery boxes which caused them to be lost, blocking progression. - It should no longer be possible to put the delivery box back onto the truck through the trailer door, which blocked progression.- ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T12:35:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1846651706684318","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Hotfix - v0.0.8","summary":"Patch notes v0.0.8You can no longer order an incomplete furniture set during the tutorial quest for the Catalog App.Reduce initial trash, stain, dust positions to improve their visibility. This will result in faster initial room activation in general.You will now get a notification when manually saving the game.Change how player character model behaves when using the Power Washer.Various minor map adjustments, collider and material optimalization improvements.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T10:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1846651706678513","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"update","title":"DEMO Hotfix - Corrupted Timeline","summary":"It seems our officers didn't understand how time zones work which caused problems with shift reports delivery for players in some countries. We made sure that all of the police officers work in a single predetermined time zone from now on :)For those of you who encountered the missing report bug - please start a new game after the update. The timeline from your savefile has been corrupted and you need to get onto the main timeline to avoid time paradoxes and collapsing of the whole universe.Chan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T16:34:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1846651706674977","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO is out!","summary":"Police Station Simulator DEMO is out NOW!The time has come - you can finally give our game a try and let us know what you think! While the feedback is not mandatory, it will help improve the final game before its full release.Want to help us out even more? Make sure to wishlist the game and tell your friends to do the same! :)Last, but not least, our celebratory sale of Bum Simulator (biggest yet!) is still going, so be sure to snatch it, if you're interested:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:53:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1816307528952021","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"announcement","title":"The Grind Continues","summary":"We are still alive and kicking. The development continues at a slow pace, but we're making progress every day. Right now we're deep in coding in and animating a lot of mundane animations like the one included below (work in progress) - all for the sake of amazing level of detail and reality of a day-to-day life at the station :)Please stick with us until the end - we will do everything in our power to make it worth the wait!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-14T16:55:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816307528952021","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2155140-1805065414364335","game_id":"steam-2155140","kind":"update","title":"Development Update","summary":"Sorry for being quiet for so long! We're not dead, and the project is not abandoned. The development of the game takes longer than anticipated, and we experienced some trouble relocating to a new office; however, we're now back on track.From now on, we will post regular updates to keep you informed about the development progress.Currently, we are still working on the core game loop, integrating various systems to ensure they work together in tandem.Once we've completed that, we will organize the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-15T12:10:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805065414364335","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news"